    <briefdescription>
<para>Store the assignments in an HDF5DataSet. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Make sure to delete this container before trying to read from the same data set (unless you pass the data set explicitly, in which case it may be OK).</para>
<para>The format on disk should not, yet, be considered stable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
